1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
在射線 AH 上移動 X，看看 AM 同 AN 有甚麼關係。
Move X along the ray AH and compare AM with AN.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:27,000
D 係不含 A 嘅弧 BC 中點，亦係圓上沿 AH 方向嘅最遠端。
D bisects the arc BC opposite A, at the far end of the circle in direction AH.

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:45,000
M 取 DX 嘅一半。過 O 畫平行於 AD 嘅直線，交 DX 得 N。
M is halfway along DX. Draw ON parallel to AD to find N on DX.

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:08,000
只拖動 X。由同一個距離 AX 同步決定 M、N 同兩條射線。
Only X moves. The same distance AX determines M, N and the two rays.

5
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:24,000
AD 平分角 BAC。先鏡射 M 成 M′，再證明 N 喺射線 AM′ 上。
AD bisects BAC. Reflect M to M′, then show that N is on the ray AM′.

6
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:40,000
O 到 A、D 等距。鏡射後，A 到 O 同 O′ 到 D 係同一個向量。
O is equidistant from A and D. Reflection gives AO and O′D the same vector.

7
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:57,000
DO 同 AX 反向。鏡射 AX，X′ 就落喺由 A 指向 O 嘅射線。
DO points opposite AX. Reflecting AX puts X′ on the ray from A through O.

8
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:16,000
DX 乘以負 R 除 t，同 DO 嘅垂直 AD 分量相同，所以等於 DN。
Multiply DX by −R/t to get DN. Its component perpendicular to AD matches DO.

9
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:31,000
M′ 係 DX′ 嘅中點。代入 AX′，比較由 A 出發嘅兩個向量。
M′ bisects DX′. Substitute AX′ and compare the two vectors from A.

10
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:51,000
比例係正數。無論 X 點移動，AN 同鏡射後嘅 AM′ 都係同一條射線。
The factor is positive. AN stays on the reflected ray AM′ as X moves.

11
00:02:51,000 --> 00:03:01,000
鏡射將 AB 變成 AC，亦將 AM 變成 AN 嘅方向，所以兩角相等。
Reflection sends the ray AB to AC and the direction AM to AN, so the angles agree.

12
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:10,000
交點 N 須唯一。若 X 同 A 重合，或 AB 等於 AC，原構造可能退化。
N must be unique. When X=A or AB=AC, the construction can degenerate.
